{"frases": [{"a": 0, "b": 1.801, "t": "Blockbuster lost everything.", "k": ["Blockbuster"], "w": [0.056, 0.783, 1.094]}, {"a": 1.801, "b": 4.192, "t": "And it all came down to one decision.", "k": ["decision."], "w": [1.851, 2.101, 2.292, 2.543, 2.853, 3.163, 3.353, 3.604]}, {"a": 4.192, "b": 7.096, "t": "But there's a detail almost nobody knows.", "k": ["there's"], "w": [4.242, 4.492, 4.922, 5.053, 5.482, 5.912, 6.341]}, {"a": 7.096, "b": 12.346, "t": "In 2000, Blockbuster was the king of movie rentals, with about 9,000 stores.", "k": ["2000,", "9,000"], "w": [7.146, 7.309, 8.065, 8.688, 8.903, 9.117, 9.383, 9.546, 9.863, 10.358, 10.623, 10.94, 11.696]}, {"a": 12.346, "b": 16.316, "t": "Netflix was a small startup mailing DVDs, and losing money.", "k": ["Netflix"], "w": [12.396, 12.879, 13.127, 13.257, 13.622, 14.106, 14.589, 14.984, 15.232, 15.656]}, {"a": 16.316, "b": 19.082, "t": "Its founders got a meeting with Blockbuster's CEO.", "k": ["Blockbuster's"], "w": [16.366, 16.589, 17.077, 17.3, 17.417, 17.852, 18.128, 18.829]}, {"a": 19.082, "b": 22.406, "t": "Their offer: sell Netflix for 50 million dollars.", "k": ["50", "dollars."], "w": [19.132, 19.461, 19.87, 20.146, 20.581, 20.804, 21.25, 21.685]}, {"a": 22.406, "b": 23.108999999999998, "t": "He listened.", "k": ["listened."], "w": [22.456, 22.618]}, {"a": 23.108999999999998, "b": 26.636, "t": "At first, he laughed, and then he followed with a flat no.", "k": ["laughed,"], "w": [23.159, 23.321, 23.71, 23.872, 24.363, 24.575, 24.838, 25.0, 25.465, 25.728, 25.839, 26.102]}, {"a": 26.636, "b": 29.296, "t": "Now the detail almost nobody knows.", "k": ["detail"], "w": [26.686, 26.944, 27.202, 27.644, 28.085, 28.527]}, {"a": 29.296, "b": 33.536, "t": "Netflix's founders got the invitation less than 12 hours before the meeting.", "k": ["12"], "w": [29.346, 29.81, 30.274, 30.485, 30.697, 31.262, 31.524, 31.786, 32.21, 32.522, 32.885, 33.097]}, {"a": 33.536, "b": 35.961000000000006, "t": "With the clock against them and almost broke,", "k": ["against"], "w": [33.586, 33.848, 34.06, 34.373, 34.786, 35.048, 35.26, 35.623]}, {"a": 35.961000000000006, "b": 39.686, "t": "they spent money they didn't have on a jet, just to hear that no.", "k": ["didn't"], "w": [36.011, 36.273, 36.586, 36.899, 37.161, 37.473, 37.736, 37.897, 38.008, 38.295, 38.557, 38.719, 38.981, 39.243]}, {"a": 39.686, "b": 43.276, "t": "They walked in wearing shorts, flip-flops and a Hawaiian shirt.", "k": ["flip-flops"], "w": [39.736, 39.999, 40.362, 40.524, 40.938, 41.378, 41.893, 42.105, 42.216, 42.681]}, {"a": 43.276, "b": 46.307, "t": "Ten years later, Blockbuster filed for bankruptcy.", "k": ["years"], "w": [43.326, 43.564, 43.916, 44.353, 45.046, 45.398, 45.636]}, {"a": 46.307, "b": 48.396, "t": "Netflix became worth billions.", "k": ["billions."], "w": [46.357, 46.822, 47.231, 47.583]}, {"a": 48.396, "b": 51.946000000000005, "t": "Today, only one Blockbuster is still alive, in Oregon.", "k": ["Blockbuster"], "w": [48.446, 48.881, 49.175, 49.412, 50.101, 50.282, 50.633, 51.068, 51.248]}, {"a": 51.946000000000005, "b": 56.486000000000004, "t": "Lesson: when a small player changes how people buy, take the meeting seriously.", "k": ["seriously."], "w": [51.996, 52.439, 52.704, 52.816, 53.132, 53.499, 53.916, 54.13, 54.497, 54.787, 55.052, 55.266, 55.684]}, {"a": 56.486000000000004, "b": 58.276, "t": "Tell me if you would have bought it.", "k": ["bought"], "w": [56.536, 56.728, 56.846, 56.964, 57.12, 57.348, 57.541, 57.806]}, {"a": 58.276, "b": 62.25, "t": "Follow for the next million dollar mistake.", "k": ["mistake."], "w": [58.326, 58.667, 58.866, 59.065, 59.311, 59.7, 60.041]}], "T": {"s_1": 7.146, "s_2": 12.396, "s_3": 16.366, "s_4": 22.456, "s_5": 26.686, "s_6": 29.346, "s_7": 39.736, "s_8": 43.326, "s_9": 48.446, "s_10": 51.996, "s_fin": 56.536, "s_cta": 58.326, "lost0": 0.783, "decision": 3.604, "king": 9.117, "m9000": 10.94, "dvds": 14.589, "losing": 15.232, "m50": 20.804, "laughed": 23.872, "flat": 25.8